Description: Translate the Kdenlive sentences of ORDER 61g continuation 6
 The two sentences a monitor says when it cannot show a 3D video in 3D (on X11,
 or after the compositor refused the declaration) now say that it shows the
 left eye's view, flat (patch 0025). Brazilian Portuguese here; the other eight
 languages come from the translations lane. English remains in the source.
Author: Daniel Campos Ramos <Capitain_Jack@yahoo.com>
Forwarded: not-needed
Last-Update: 2026-11-22

diff --git a/po/pt_BR/kdenlive.po b/po/pt_BR/kdenlive.po
--- a/po/pt_BR/kdenlive.po
+++ b/po/pt_BR/kdenlive.po
@@ -39,6 +39,13 @@
 msgid "This monitor cannot show the video in 3D: %1 It shows the packed frame as it is."
 msgstr "Este monitor não consegue mostrar o vídeo em 3D: %1 Ele mostra o quadro empacotado como está."
 
+msgid "This monitor shows a 3D video in 3D only when Kdenlive runs on Wayland. It shows the left eye's view, flat."
+msgstr "Este monitor mostra um vídeo 3D em 3D só quando o Kdenlive roda no Wayland. Ele mostra a vista do olho esquerdo, plana."
+
+#, kde-format
+msgid "This monitor cannot show the video in 3D: %1 It shows the left eye's view, flat."
+msgstr "Este monitor não consegue mostrar o vídeo em 3D: %1 Ele mostra a vista do olho esquerdo, plana."
+
 msgctxt "Why the monitor cannot show 3D, ends the sentence: This monitor cannot show the video in 3D: %1"
 msgid "the monitor's window has no Wayland surface."
 msgstr "a janela do monitor não tem uma superfície Wayland."
